msgid ""
"Advanced data structures solve specialised computational problems with "
"remarkable efficiency guarantees. They go beyond standard collections by "
"exploiting probabilistic techniques, internal algorithmic optimisations, "
"and hybrid designs to achieve near-constant time complexity, compact "
"space usage, or bounded-error estimation."
msgstr ""

